<title>JAPAN: Shoei - 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Shoei - 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.49		vs	   14.16</p>
<p> Operating	  920    million    vs	    1.26</p>
<p> Current	    790    million    vs	    1.43</p>
